				},
				{
					"children": [
						{
							"detail": 0,
							"format": 0,
							"mode": "normal",
							"style": "",
							"text": "青森",
							"type": "extended-text",
							"version": 1
						}
					],
					"direction": "ltr",
					"format": "",
					"indent": 0,
					"type": "extended-heading",
					"version": 1,
					"tag": "h2"
				},
				{
					"children": [
						{
							"detail": 0,
							"format": 0,
							"mode": "normal",
							"style": "",
							"text": "そのまま帰る予定だったけど会社の社長に回収してもらって、そのまま青森の社長の実家に一泊させてもらうことに。話には聞いてたけど料理がめちゃくちゃ美味しかった。",
							"type": "extended-text",
							"version": 1
						}
					],
					"direction": "ltr",
					"format": "",
					"indent": 0,
					"type": "paragraph",
					"version": 1
				},
				{
					"children": [
						{
							"detail": 0,
							"format": 0,
							"mode": "normal",
							"style": "",
							"text": "そして念願の三内丸山遺跡に。竪穴住居がめっちゃある！",
							"type": "extended-text",
							"version": 1
						}
					],
					"direction": "ltr",
					"format": "",
					"indent": 0,
					"type": "paragraph",
					"version": 1
				},
				{
					"type": "image",
					"version": 1,
					"src": "https://hanatane.net/content/images/2025/06/5106FDF6-A6FD-4665-B69B-9C9DEBBEE9CA.jpeg",
					"width": 6000,
					"height": 4000,
					"title": "",
					"alt": "",
					"caption": "<span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Sigma fp 45mm F2.8 DG DN | Contemporary 019</span>",
					"cardWidth": "regular",
					"href": ""
				},
				{
					"children": [
						{
							"detail": 0,
							"format": 0,
							"mode": "normal",
							"style": "",
							"text": "地元の小学生たちが作ったものらしい。大船渡でも是非作りたい。",
							"type": "extended-text",
							"version": 1
						}
					],
					"direction": "ltr",
					"format": "",
					"indent": 0,
					"type": "paragraph",
					"version": 1
				},
				{
					"type": "image",
					"version": 1,
					"src": "https://hanatane.net/content/images/2025/06/F542A5DC-D80E-4CAC-B933-A01560ACE122.jpeg",
					"width": 6000,
					"height": 4000,
					"title": "",
					"alt": "",
					"caption": "<span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Sigma fp 45mm F2.8 DG DN | Contemporary 019</span>",
					"cardWidth": "regular",
					"href": ""
				},
				{
					"children": [
						{
							"detail": 0,
							"format": 0,
							"mode": "normal",
							"style": "",
							"text": "結構いろんなタイプがあって、日差しは結構強くても中に入ると案外涼しい。",
							"type": "extended-text",
							"version": 1
						}
					],
					"direction": "ltr",
					"format": "",
					"indent": 0,
					"type": "paragraph",
					"version": 1
				},
				{
					"type": "image",
					"version": 1,
					"src": "https://hanatane.net/content/images/2025/06/21ED56D2-10A1-4A9C-A487-F19703AA69CC.jpeg",
					"width": 6000,
					"height": 4000,
					"title": "",
					"alt": "",
					"caption": "<span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Sigma fp 45mm F2.8 DG DN | Contemporary 019</span>",
					"cardWidth": "regular",
					"href": ""
				},
				{
					"type": "image",
					"version": 1,
					"src": "https://hanatane.net/content/images/2025/06/C0D73517-66D8-4A65-921A-A29093648D98.jpeg",
					"width": 6000,
					"height": 4000,
					"title": "",
					"alt": "",
					"caption": "<span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Sigma fp 45mm F2.8 DG DN | Contemporary 019</span>",
					"cardWidth": "regular",
					"href": ""
				},
				{
					"children": [
						{
							"detail": 0,
							"format": 0,
							"mode": "normal",
							"style": "",
							"text": "三内丸山の巨大建築は屋根の部分が諸説あって作られていないけど、期間ごとにいろんな説の屋根つけてくれたら面白そう。予算的に無理か。",
							"type": "extended-text",
							"version": 1
						}
					],
					"direction": "ltr",
					"format": "",
					"indent": 0,
					"type": "paragraph",
					"version": 1
				},
				{
					"children": [
						{
							"detail": 0,
							"format": 0,
							"mode": "normal",
							"style": "",
							"text": "物見櫓という説もあるけど、普通にフロアをブチあげるステージだったんじゃないかなぁと思った。かなり太い柱なので集落の労働力を相当使う必要があるだろうし、実用性重視の物見だったらもう少しコンパクトに作れたんじゃないかなぁと思うなど。",
							"type": "extended-text",
							"version": 1
						}
					],
					"direction": "ltr",
					"format": "",
					"indent": 0,
					"type": "paragraph",
					"version": 1
				},
				{
					"type": "image",
					"version": 1,
					"src": "https://hanatane.net/content/images/2025/06/D97E6717-1FFA-41B1-BF06-4F9E84552A03.jpeg",
					"width": 6000,
					"height": 4000,
					"title": "",
					"alt": "",
					"caption": "<span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Sigma fp 45mm F2.8 DG DN | Contemporary 019</span>",
					"cardWidth": "regular",
					"href": ""
				},
				{
					"children": [
						{
							"detail": 0,
							"format": 0,
							"mode": "normal",
							"style": "",
							"text": "帰りは八甲田山ルートを通った。そこら中から温泉が出ている。",
							"type": "extended-text",
							"version": 1
						}
					],
					"direction": "ltr",
					"format": "",
					"indent": 0,
					"type": "paragraph",
					"version": 1
				},
				{
					"type": "image",
					"version": 1,
					"src": "https://hanatane.net/content/images/2025/06/5C8B9BDB-2F45-4275-89BF-151EB28A9803.jpeg",
					"width": 6000,
					"height": 4000,
					"title": "",
					"alt": "",
					"caption": "<span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Sigma fp 45mm F2.8 DG DN | Contemporary 019</span>",
					"cardWidth": "regular",
					"href": ""
				},
				{
					"children": [
						{
							"detail": 0,
							"format": 0,
							"mode": "normal",
							"style": "",
							"text": "十和田湖。でっかい。",
							"type": "extended-text",
							"version": 1
						}
					],
					"direction": "ltr",
					"format": "",
					"indent": 0,
					"type": "paragraph",
					"version": 1
				},
				{
					"type": "image",
					"version": 1,
					"src": "https://hanatane.net/content/images/2025/06/F98B30FD-F7CB-4C16-A1BB-D3005887CFE8.jpeg",
					"width": 6000,
					"height": 4000,
					"title": "",
					"alt": "",
					"caption": "<span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Sigma fp 45mm F2.8 DG DN | Contemporary 019</span>",
					"cardWidth": "regular",
					"href": ""
				},
				{
					"children": [
						{
							"detail": 0,
							"format": 0,
							"mode": "normal",
							"style": "",
							"text": "秘境を抜けて田子という街に出た。にんにくの生産が日本一らしい。こういう町が定期的に現れるので東北めぐりも楽しそうでバイクとかが欲しくなった。",
							"type": "extended-text",
							"version": 1
						}
					],
					"direction": "ltr",
					"format": "",
					"indent": 0,
					"type": "paragraph",
					"version": 1
				},
				{
					"type": "image",
					"version": 1,
					"src": "https://hanatane.net/content/images/2025/06/IMG_6334.jpeg",
					"width": 4284,
					"height": 5712,
					"title": "",
					"alt": "",
					"caption": "<span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">iPhone 16 Pro</span>",
					"cardWidth": "regular",
					"href": ""
				},
				{
					"children": [
						{
							"detail": 0,
							"format": 0,
							"mode": "normal",
							"style": "",
							"text": "まとめ",
							"type": "extended-text",
							"version": 1
						}
					],
					"direction": "ltr",
					"format": "",
					"indent": 0,
					"type": "extended-heading",
					"version": 1,
					"tag": "h2"
				},
				{
					"children": [
						{
							"detail": 0,
							"format": 0,
							"mode": "normal",
							"style": "",
							"text": "北海道〜北東北で色々詰め込んだ旅になったけど、自分的には結構共通するテーマがあったように思う。生態学でみられるような生物学の視点で自分は結構物事を見ている。",
							"type": "extended-text",
							"version": 1
						}
					],
					"direction": "ltr",
					"format": "",
					"indent": 0,
					"type": "paragraph",
					"version": 1
				},
				{
					"children": [
						{
							"detail": 0,
							"format": 0,
							"mode": "normal",
							"style": "",
							"text": "三内丸山遺跡は最終氷期の終わりであるとか二度の噴火で作られた地形とか様々な条件下で花開いた文化であるし、生成AIはこれまでの前提を色々ひっくり返してしまう人類史的なイベントになることは間違いない。",
							"type": "extended-text",
							"version": 1
						}
					],
					"direction": "ltr",
					"format": "",
					"indent": 0,
					"type": "paragraph",
					"version": 1
				},
				{
					"children": [
						{
							"detail": 0,
							"format": 0,
							"mode": "normal",
							"style": "",
							"text": "種差の授業で日本でそれなりに植物とうまくやっているコイが、オーストラリアでは現地の植物に壊滅的な影響を与える侵略的外来種で、なにがその違いを生んでいるのかと問われた。オーストラリアでは現地の水性植物とコイが共進化するスキマがなかったというのが一応の回答になるらしい。",
							"type": "extended-text",
							"version": 1
						}
					],
					"direction": "ltr",
					"format": "",
					"indent": 0,
					"type": "paragraph",
					"version": 1
				},
				{
					"children": [
						{
							"detail": 0,
							"format": 0,
							"mode": "normal",
							"style": "",
							"text": "共進化でよくみられる共生関係は様々で、例えば宿主とウイルスのような対抗でも起こり得るのだから、凄まじいディスラプトを伴う生成AIとヒトの関係のヒントになりそうだ。激変する環境変化が実際に起っていて、境界を超えてリスクを取っている個体の適応度が高くなるということがどんどん観測されるんだろうなと思った。",
							"type": "extended-text",
							"version": 1
						}
					],
					"direction": "ltr",
					"format": "",
					"indent": 0,
					"type": "paragraph",
					"version": 1
				},
				{
					"children": [
						{
							"detail": 0,
							"format": 0,
							"mode": "normal",
							"style": "",
							"text": "何はともあれとても楽しかった。終わり！",
							"type": "extended-text",
							"version": 1
						}
					],
					"direction": "ltr",
					"format": "",
					"indent": 0,
					"type": "paragraph",
					"version": 1
				}
			],
			"direction": "ltr",
			"format": "",
			"indent": 0,
			"type": "root",
			"version": 1
		}
	}
